{"1221480":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Big Hops Together","steam_appid":1221480,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[4204860],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/5747d9d5c4add5d0f166be75ff2df8c2.poster.avif?t=1791874181\" width=800 height=62 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/5747d9d5c4add5d0f166be75ff2df8c2.webm?t=1791874181\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/5747d9d5c4add5d0f166be75ff2df8c2.mp4?t=1791874181\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/f7f96a1e4f148af82da79e772f4a006b.avif?t=1791874181\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras_big\/f7f96a1e4f148af82da79e772f4a006b.avif?t=1791874181 width=800 height=105 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Movement is king in BIG HOPS and our kit goes deep.<\/strong> You can roll, dive, crouch jump, wall run, free climb, swim, belly slide, walk tightropes, pole swing, grind rails, ride minecarts and more. Everyone knows a great platformer starts with a great player controller and Hops' stacks up against the best-of-the-best.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/aa4f4953afd9cc227828500739cdacdf.poster.avif?t=1791874181\" width=706 height=318 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/aa4f4953afd9cc227828500739cdacdf.webm?t=1791874181\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/aa4f4953afd9cc227828500739cdacdf.mp4?t=1791874181\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll feel inspiration from <i>Mario<\/i>, <i>Sonic Adventure<\/i>, <i>Zelda: Breath of the Wild, Hat in Time,<\/i> and more. And that's all just Hop's basic moveset- from there we've added a ton of froggy flavor and ways to build your own paths forward.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/4a59c1926421e30ef70bc453bee38106.avif?t=1791874181\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras_big\/4a59c1926421e30ef70bc453bee38106.avif?t=1791874181 width=800 height=105 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The core-mechanic in BIG HOPS is Hop's versatile frog tongue!<\/strong> It's cute, goofy, and adds a surprising amount of freshness to this action-puzzle-platformer<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/55c893ac707f641574c4bf83566fe3b4.poster.avif?t=1791874181\" width=786 height=374 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/55c893ac707f641574c4bf83566fe3b4.webm?t=1791874181\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/55c893ac707f641574c4bf83566fe3b4.mp4?t=1791874181\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your tongue is how you interact<\/strong>. Use your tongue to pull items to your hands, hookshot up walls, and tongue-swing your way to ridiculous speeds.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/f9c4cd396761a973cf73ab47101a133c.poster.avif?t=1791874181\" width=748 height=328 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/f9c4cd396761a973cf73ab47101a133c.webm?t=1791874181\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/f9c4cd396761a973cf73ab47101a133c.mp4?t=1791874181\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doors, switches, corks, plungers, flowers, flingers, levers, and lick-picking are all quick work thanks to Hop's tongue. <strong>You'll keep finding novel, goofy tongue interactions even 10+ hours into your playthrough.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/9dcdb2871596de192108b2f2be6356ac.avif?t=1791874181\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras_big\/9dcdb2871596de192108b2f2be6356ac.avif?t=1791874181 width=800 height=105 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep movement and tongue-gameplay give BIG HOPS legs and a fresh flavor, but <strong>the real magic is using powerful Veggies to build your own paths through levels<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/7f8d16c1bd89e9a6e33b59bf5e0ed52a.avif?t=1791874181\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras_big\/7f8d16c1bd89e9a6e33b59bf5e0ed52a.avif?t=1791874181 width=800 height=123 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/78d8482baac7de27498ad566774f9dfc.poster.avif?t=1791874181\" width=600 height=286 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/78d8482baac7de27498ad566774f9dfc.webm?t=1791874181\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/78d8482baac7de27498ad566774f9dfc.mp4?t=1791874181\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You'll find new types of Veggies as you explore and each has a unique effect when you throw it down in the world<\/strong>. Let's look at some examples:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mushrooms <\/strong>become bounce pads to help clear hard jumps.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Acorns <\/strong>can grow vines around walls and ceilings to help you climb farther.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Balloons<\/strong> make temporary platforms and can stack to get serious height.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oil Balls<\/strong> create hookshot points you can bounce off without losing speed.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Apples<\/strong> let you place your own tongue swinging points anywhere.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cacti <\/strong>launch tightropes you can use to cross big gaps.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/6234960ada82706109073d995d70c6ab.poster.avif?t=1791874181\" width=800 height=354 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/6234960ada82706109073d995d70c6ab.webm?t=1791874181\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/6234960ada82706109073d995d70c6ab.mp4?t=1791874181\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Since you can only hold one item at a time, Hop has a handy Backpack! <\/strong>As you play, you'll discover new <strong>Veggies <\/strong>and unlock more <strong>Backpack Slots<\/strong> to store them. You can open the <strong>Backpack<\/strong> any time, and using it in a stressful moment will slow down time so you can plan your next moves.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/7895629524deb08cfd0df67de7714d3b.avif?t=1791874181\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras_big\/7895629524deb08cfd0df67de7714d3b.avif?t=1791874181 width=800 height=105 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collectibles<\/strong> are a genre staple and there are lots in BIG HOPS! We've worked hard to give them all gameplay uses, so you never feel like you're just checking off boxes<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/ba8e4457e26d0e5fe2e7827ef84d331f.avif?t=1791874181\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras_big\/ba8e4457e26d0e5fe2e7827ef84d331f.avif?t=1791874181 width=800 height=545 \/><\/span><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn <strong>Dark Drips<\/strong> to help with Diss' mysterious mission and unlock secrets.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>Dark Bits<\/strong> to earn gameplay modifying <strong>Trinkets<\/strong> for your backpack.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy <strong>Veggies <\/strong>+ upgrade your <strong>Backpack<\/strong>, <strong>Wallet<\/strong>, and more at <i>Drilson's Depot<\/i>.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy <strong>Outfits<\/strong>, <strong>Hats<\/strong>, &amp; <strong>Dyes <\/strong>to customize Hop's look at <i>Odette's Outfitters<\/i>.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and Identify real <strong>Bugs<\/strong> to fill your collection in <i>Bugsy's Conservatory.<\/i><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover <strong>Blueprints <\/strong>to build <i>totally normal<\/i> and not-at-all busted <strong>Gadgets<\/strong>.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find <strong>Mixtapes<\/strong> to play on in-game on your <strong>Boombox <\/strong>or <strong>Hop-man<\/strong>.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/cb33dda9b53cbfa1bc24d7f40c89723b.avif?t=1791874181\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras_big\/cb33dda9b53cbfa1bc24d7f40c89723b.avif?t=1791874181 width=800 height=108 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/059cca29da5bd8e7669a80b614e04a35.poster.avif?t=1791874181\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/059cca29da5bd8e7669a80b614e04a35.webm?t=1791874181\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/059cca29da5bd8e7669a80b614e04a35.mp4?t=1791874181\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipping Trinkets means decorating your Backpack!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/85740ba0cbc16935ff0cc9c0d017415d.poster.avif?t=1791874181\" width=680 height=380 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/85740ba0cbc16935ff0cc9c0d017415d.webm?t=1791874181\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/85740ba0cbc16935ff0cc9c0d017415d.mp4?t=1791874181\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's a weird bug...<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/fddc421a8e70b7dfe6e718be881eeec0.avif?t=1791874181\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras_big\/fddc421a8e70b7dfe6e718be881eeec0.avif?t=1791874181 width=800 height=105 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Something we're proud of is how many different areas there are in BIG HOPS.<\/strong> As you explore the 4 main Worlds (Forest, Desert, Ocean, and Mountain), expect a lot of surprising offshoots like the Boneyard, Bucko Cove, Hydro Plant, and Gulley Gang HQ. All these different places to explore really make it feel like you're on a grand adventure!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/e3529e897257a2cc4dc6dec09b3382a7.avif?t=1791874181\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras_big\/e3529e897257a2cc4dc6dec09b3382a7.avif?t=1791874181 width=800 height=1350 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/b3df50f91af728db64a8b9369e851641.avif?t=1791874181\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras_big\/b3df50f91af728db64a8b9369e851641.avif?t=1791874181 width=800 height=105 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi, Chris here! <strong>I started BIG HOPS in 2019 (6 years ago!!!) with a single goal of modernizing the 3D platformer genre.<\/strong> The design trend at the time of giving players real freedom and creativity in games like <i>Zelda: Breath of the Wild<\/i>, <i>Spelunky<\/i>, and <i>Rimworld<\/i> was so inspiring. Selfishly and jealously, I wanted to see <strong>emergent gameplay<\/strong> in my favorite genre.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since then, BIG HOPS has become a maximalist game and taken on many more ideas and inspirations. Its mechanics, story, vibes, and humor draw on so many games and TV shows stretching back 40 years. <i><strong>Mario<\/strong><\/i><strong> (64, Odyssey, Sunshine, and Galaxy) and <i>Zelda<\/i> (BOTW, Wind Waker, and Ocarina of Time) have both been huge influences.<\/strong> We also spend a lot of time talking about<i> Sonic Adventure<\/i>, <i>Spelunky<\/i>, <i>Kingdom Hearts<\/i>, <i>Psychonauts<\/i>, <i>Avatar: The Last Airbender<\/i>, <i>Spongebob<\/i>, and <i>Steven Universe<\/i>. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/ac944d03e328d703198efdfb575c6c6a.avif?t=1791874181\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras_big\/ac944d03e328d703198efdfb575c6c6a.avif?t=1791874181 width=800 height=105 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I founded <i>Luckshot Games <\/i>in 2015 to make innovative, high quality games filled to the brim with character and charm. We funded our first game <i>Sausage Sports Club<\/i> on Kickstarter way back then and released it on Switch and Steam in 2018. We've aimed higher with BIG HOPS and the team is bigger than just <i>Luckshot Games, <\/i>so I want to give everyone a quick shout:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/9d55021e73020ef540eb8bdd6e89fddc.avif?t=1791874181\" width=800 height=339 \/><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/5747d9d5c4add5d0f166be75ff2df8c2.poster.avif?t=1791874181\" width=800 height=62 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/5747d9d5c4add5d0f166be75ff2df8c2.webm?t=1791874181\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/5747d9d5c4add5d0f166be75ff2df8c2.mp4?t=1791874181\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/f7f96a1e4f148af82da79e772f4a006b.avif?t=1791874181\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras_big\/f7f96a1e4f148af82da79e772f4a006b.avif?t=1791874181 width=800 height=105 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Movement is king in BIG HOPS and our kit goes deep.<\/strong> You can roll, dive, crouch jump, wall run, free climb, swim, belly slide, walk tightropes, pole swing, grind rails, ride minecarts and more. Everyone knows a great platformer starts with a great player controller and Hops' stacks up against the best-of-the-best.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/aa4f4953afd9cc227828500739cdacdf.poster.avif?t=1791874181\" width=706 height=318 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/aa4f4953afd9cc227828500739cdacdf.webm?t=1791874181\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/aa4f4953afd9cc227828500739cdacdf.mp4?t=1791874181\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll feel inspiration from <i>Mario<\/i>, <i>Sonic Adventure<\/i>, <i>Zelda: Breath of the Wild, Hat in Time,<\/i> and more. And that's all just Hop's basic moveset- from there we've added a ton of froggy flavor and ways to build your own paths forward.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/4a59c1926421e30ef70bc453bee38106.avif?t=1791874181\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras_big\/4a59c1926421e30ef70bc453bee38106.avif?t=1791874181 width=800 height=105 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The core-mechanic in BIG HOPS is Hop's versatile frog tongue!<\/strong> It's cute, goofy, and adds a surprising amount of freshness to this action-puzzle-platformer<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/55c893ac707f641574c4bf83566fe3b4.poster.avif?t=1791874181\" width=786 height=374 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/55c893ac707f641574c4bf83566fe3b4.webm?t=1791874181\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/55c893ac707f641574c4bf83566fe3b4.mp4?t=1791874181\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your tongue is how you interact<\/strong>. Use your tongue to pull items to your hands, hookshot up walls, and tongue-swing your way to ridiculous speeds.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/f9c4cd396761a973cf73ab47101a133c.poster.avif?t=1791874181\" width=748 height=328 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/f9c4cd396761a973cf73ab47101a133c.webm?t=1791874181\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/f9c4cd396761a973cf73ab47101a133c.mp4?t=1791874181\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doors, switches, corks, plungers, flowers, flingers, levers, and lick-picking are all quick work thanks to Hop's tongue. <strong>You'll keep finding novel, goofy tongue interactions even 10+ hours into your playthrough.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/9dcdb2871596de192108b2f2be6356ac.avif?t=1791874181\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras_big\/9dcdb2871596de192108b2f2be6356ac.avif?t=1791874181 width=800 height=105 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep movement and tongue-gameplay give BIG HOPS legs and a fresh flavor, but <strong>the real magic is using powerful Veggies to build your own paths through levels<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/7f8d16c1bd89e9a6e33b59bf5e0ed52a.avif?t=1791874181\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras_big\/7f8d16c1bd89e9a6e33b59bf5e0ed52a.avif?t=1791874181 width=800 height=123 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/78d8482baac7de27498ad566774f9dfc.poster.avif?t=1791874181\" width=600 height=286 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/78d8482baac7de27498ad566774f9dfc.webm?t=1791874181\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/78d8482baac7de27498ad566774f9dfc.mp4?t=1791874181\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You'll find new types of Veggies as you explore and each has a unique effect when you throw it down in the world<\/strong>. Let's look at some examples:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mushrooms <\/strong>become bounce pads to help clear hard jumps.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Acorns <\/strong>can grow vines around walls and ceilings to help you climb farther.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Balloons<\/strong> make temporary platforms and can stack to get serious height.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oil Balls<\/strong> create hookshot points you can bounce off without losing speed.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Apples<\/strong> let you place your own tongue swinging points anywhere.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cacti <\/strong>launch tightropes you can use to cross big gaps.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/6234960ada82706109073d995d70c6ab.poster.avif?t=1791874181\" width=800 height=354 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/6234960ada82706109073d995d70c6ab.webm?t=1791874181\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/6234960ada82706109073d995d70c6ab.mp4?t=1791874181\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Since you can only hold one item at a time, Hop has a handy Backpack! <\/strong>As you play, you'll discover new <strong>Veggies <\/strong>and unlock more <strong>Backpack Slots<\/strong> to store them. You can open the <strong>Backpack<\/strong> any time, and using it in a stressful moment will slow down time so you can plan your next moves.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/7895629524deb08cfd0df67de7714d3b.avif?t=1791874181\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras_big\/7895629524deb08cfd0df67de7714d3b.avif?t=1791874181 width=800 height=105 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collectibles<\/strong> are a genre staple and there are lots in BIG HOPS! We've worked hard to give them all gameplay uses, so you never feel like you're just checking off boxes<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/ba8e4457e26d0e5fe2e7827ef84d331f.avif?t=1791874181\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras_big\/ba8e4457e26d0e5fe2e7827ef84d331f.avif?t=1791874181 width=800 height=545 \/><\/span><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn <strong>Dark Drips<\/strong> to help with Diss' mysterious mission and unlock secrets.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>Dark Bits<\/strong> to earn gameplay modifying <strong>Trinkets<\/strong> for your backpack.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy <strong>Veggies <\/strong>+ upgrade your <strong>Backpack<\/strong>, <strong>Wallet<\/strong>, and more at <i>Drilson's Depot<\/i>.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy <strong>Outfits<\/strong>, <strong>Hats<\/strong>, &amp; <strong>Dyes <\/strong>to customize Hop's look at <i>Odette's Outfitters<\/i>.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and Identify real <strong>Bugs<\/strong> to fill your collection in <i>Bugsy's Conservatory.<\/i><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover <strong>Blueprints <\/strong>to build <i>totally normal<\/i> and not-at-all busted <strong>Gadgets<\/strong>.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find <strong>Mixtapes<\/strong> to play on in-game on your <strong>Boombox <\/strong>or <strong>Hop-man<\/strong>.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/cb33dda9b53cbfa1bc24d7f40c89723b.avif?t=1791874181\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras_big\/cb33dda9b53cbfa1bc24d7f40c89723b.avif?t=1791874181 width=800 height=108 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/059cca29da5bd8e7669a80b614e04a35.poster.avif?t=1791874181\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/059cca29da5bd8e7669a80b614e04a35.webm?t=1791874181\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/059cca29da5bd8e7669a80b614e04a35.mp4?t=1791874181\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipping Trinkets means decorating your Backpack!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/85740ba0cbc16935ff0cc9c0d017415d.poster.avif?t=1791874181\" width=680 height=380 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/85740ba0cbc16935ff0cc9c0d017415d.webm?t=1791874181\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/85740ba0cbc16935ff0cc9c0d017415d.mp4?t=1791874181\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's a weird bug...<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/fddc421a8e70b7dfe6e718be881eeec0.avif?t=1791874181\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras_big\/fddc421a8e70b7dfe6e718be881eeec0.avif?t=1791874181 width=800 height=105 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Something we're proud of is how many different areas there are in BIG HOPS.<\/strong> As you explore the 4 main Worlds (Forest, Desert, Ocean, and Mountain), expect a lot of surprising offshoots like the Boneyard, Bucko Cove, Hydro Plant, and Gulley Gang HQ. All these different places to explore really make it feel like you're on a grand adventure!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/e3529e897257a2cc4dc6dec09b3382a7.avif?t=1791874181\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras_big\/e3529e897257a2cc4dc6dec09b3382a7.avif?t=1791874181 width=800 height=1350 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/b3df50f91af728db64a8b9369e851641.avif?t=1791874181\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras_big\/b3df50f91af728db64a8b9369e851641.avif?t=1791874181 width=800 height=105 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi, Chris here! <strong>I started BIG HOPS in 2019 (6 years ago!!!) with a single goal of modernizing the 3D platformer genre.<\/strong> The design trend at the time of giving players real freedom and creativity in games like <i>Zelda: Breath of the Wild<\/i>, <i>Spelunky<\/i>, and <i>Rimworld<\/i> was so inspiring. Selfishly and jealously, I wanted to see <strong>emergent gameplay<\/strong> in my favorite genre.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since then, BIG HOPS has become a maximalist game and taken on many more ideas and inspirations. Its mechanics, story, vibes, and humor draw on so many games and TV shows stretching back 40 years. <i><strong>Mario<\/strong><\/i><strong> (64, Odyssey, Sunshine, and Galaxy) and <i>Zelda<\/i> (BOTW, Wind Waker, and Ocarina of Time) have both been huge influences.<\/strong> We also spend a lot of time talking about<i> Sonic Adventure<\/i>, <i>Spelunky<\/i>, <i>Kingdom Hearts<\/i>, <i>Psychonauts<\/i>, <i>Avatar: The Last Airbender<\/i>, <i>Spongebob<\/i>, and <i>Steven Universe<\/i>. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/ac944d03e328d703198efdfb575c6c6a.avif?t=1791874181\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras_big\/ac944d03e328d703198efdfb575c6c6a.avif?t=1791874181 width=800 height=105 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I founded <i>Luckshot Games <\/i>in 2015 to make innovative, high quality games filled to the brim with character and charm. We funded our first game <i>Sausage Sports Club<\/i> on Kickstarter way back then and released it on Switch and Steam in 2018. We've aimed higher with BIG HOPS and the team is bigger than just <i>Luckshot Games, <\/i>so I want to give everyone a quick shout:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/extras\/9d55021e73020ef540eb8bdd6e89fddc.avif?t=1791874181\" width=800 height=339 \/><\/span><\/p>","short_description":"Tongue-swing, free climb, and build your own paths in a fresh 3D platformer! Plant veggie bounce pads, tightropes, and hookshots to find a way home through huge Desert, Ocean, and Mountain worlds. Collect bugs, upgrade your backpack, and make animal friends as you go! Just added: 8 Player Co-op","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong>, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil<br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","reviews":"“BIG HOPS succeeds because of the developers’ understanding of momentum, accessibility, and expression through movement: its systems constantly invite wacky experimentation with generous restarts, rather than punishing the player for failing, all of which reinforces a core philosophy of playful improvisation.”<br>Giant Bomb<br><br>“Big Hops feels like you're breaking the game and finding your own way, only to realize that Luckshot gave you that degree of freedom on purpose, and often knew how you'd use it.”<br>GameSpot<br><br>“Tongue grappling combines with air diving to create an expressive traversal system where players can cross long gaps with the right planning. Roll off an edge, jump, and dive to extend movement in the same way Mario can with Cappy in Odyssey. It all feels remarkably smooth, especially when combined with some Breath of the Wild-esque wall clinging that allows players to cut through stages any way they like with careful stamina management.”<br>Polygon<br>","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/3599b41f9f52b8b6030c7c1355e141053baef7cb\/header.jpg?t=1791874181","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/deee5771edf0ab1195e04bc5df20085b0887ec3d\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1791874181","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1221480\/deee5771edf0ab1195e04bc5df20085b0887ec3d\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1791874181","website":"https:\/\/luckshotgames.com\/","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS *:<\/strong> Windows 7<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5 2.8Ghz or higher<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Geforce GTX 1060 or higher<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 10<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 5 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/stro